# The menus: Journey (locked stages), Challenges (Pentafold's nine columns,
# a drop by key 9, the pause sheet's Leave to menu), Learn (the Make four
# lesson rejecting a column it does not teach, then completing on column 7),
# the Daily board, Settings (the erase confirmation cancelled), Help.
until 600 Make four in a row
frames 30
click =Journey
until 120 Stars come from winning
frames 20
save journey
expect Locked
click =Back
until 120 Make four in a row
frames 10
click =Challenges
until 120 Each challenge states its rules
frames 10
save challenges
click =Pentafold
until 120 FIVE in a row
frames 60
key Digit9 1
frames 5
until 600 =Your turn
frames 60
save pentafold
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave to menu
frames 10
click =Leave to menu
until 120 Resume Pentafold
frames 10
click =Learn
until 120 Short lessons
frames 10
click =Make four
until 120 Column 7, 0 of 6 filled
frames 30
key Digit1 1
until 60 This lesson wants column 7.
frames 10
key Digit7 1
until 300 =You made four
frames 60
save lesson
click =Back to menu
until 120 Make four in a row
frames 10
click =Daily board
until 120 =Your turn
frames 30
save daily
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave to menu
frames 10
click =Leave to menu
until 120 Make four in a row
frames 10
click =Settings
until 120 Open Options
frames 10
click Erase progress on this device
until 60 Erase all Fourfold progress
frames 10
save settings
click =Cancel
frames 10
click =Back
until 120 Make four in a row
frames 10
click =Help and rules
until 120 How to play
frames 10
save help
click =Back
until 120 Make four in a row
